# Each harness run writes eval/results/<utc-timestamp>.json (and
# baseline-<utc>.json for the baseline-comparison run, and
# scaling-<utc>.json for the scaling run).  Only the checked-in reference
# runs (sample.json, sample-baseline.json, sample-scaling.json) and the
# canonical scaling plot are tracked.
*.json
!sample.json
!sample-baseline.json
!sample-scaling.json
